## System Architecture

The ATM Machine Simulation System follows a modular architecture. The main program controls the application flow and connects the ATM menu with authentication, account management, transactions, transaction history, validation, and account data storage.

### Architecture Flow

main.py
↓
atm.py
↓
├── authentication.py → Login and PIN verification
├── account.py → Account creation, details, and PIN change
├── transactions.py → Deposit, withdrawal, balance, and transfer
├── transaction_history.py → Transaction history
└── validation.py → Input validation
↓
database.py → Stores account and transaction data